  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revised DWCP Kuwait contributes to achievement of decent work agenda in the National Development Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first United Nations Cooperation Framework (UNCF) is completed in close consultation between the UN agencies and the Government as well as with stakeholders. It is expected to be signed with the Government very soon.
Based on the signature of  the UNCF, the ILO, in close collaboration with the tripartite constituents will revise the Decent Work Country Programme for Kuwait leading to its implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
